# W13 settings/features parity at 0.3.393

Frozen v1 source **0cb7a8a0** is compared with shipping product **f199980d68ddef02634f07109a33de5bbe3470cd** and release commit **e53256e17f27d43d27ae17ee411d11fc5b5ccc7b** (identical trees). The 87-row table inventories every user-facing category from v1 settings, menus, rack, browser, keyboard, sound/performance views, mixer and diagnostics. Present means a reachable control and backing implementation exist; it does not certify authored audio, native presentation, CPU or DAW recall. This updates the historical [326 inventory](w13-settings-parity-030326.md).

The source census hashes 35 v1 files against393, including every v1 `src/ui/*.rs` plus library, plugin, routing, timing, cache, creator and engine/overrides. Removed menu command names were traced to their v2 equivalents rather than counted as missing features. The two actual omissions are Edit sound and Route to… shortcuts. Literal menu-label differences were also traced: Import from Kontakt → Find installed libraries; Library folders… → Settings…; Logs and support report… → Report…; articulation original-key, participation and velocity-split actions retain their backing paths under shorter labels. This slice copies v1 menu labels, ordering and EditSound execution, adapting StripRoute to the existing nested-mixer picker and the global v1 Sound tab to v2’s selected-part Sound/Controls view.

